  <summary>Live network download/upload speed in the COSMIC panel</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Network Speed shows the current download and upload throughput of your
      active network interface directly in the COSMIC panel. It automatically
      picks the busiest non-loopback, non-virtual interface and updates once
      per second.
    </p>
    <p>
      Click the panel entry to open a popup with the interface name and
      current download/upload speed.
    </p>
  </description>
